    {"key": "prakash", "phone": "+919000001103", "language": "or", "name": "Prakash Mohapatra", "name_native": "ପ୍ରକାଶ ମହାପାତ୍ର", "village": "Raghurajpur", "district": "Puri", "state": "Odisha", "craft_type": "Pattachitra", "years_practice": 25, "gender": "male", "cluster": "Pattachitra artisans, Puri", "gi_tag": "Orissa Pattachitra", "pehchan_id": "OD00023757", "verified": true, "new_artisan": false, "story_text": "ମୋ ବାପା ଓ ଜେଜେବାପା ପଟଚିତ୍ର କରୁଥିଲେ। ମୁଁ ପ୍ରାକୃତିକ ରଙ୍ଗରେ ଜଗନ୍ନାଥଙ୍କ କାହାଣୀ ଆଙ୍କେ।"},
